Combining Different Capabilities 
Consider a user who asks: "Analyze last month's sales, compare them with the previous 
month, identify the main changes, and prepare a short report."

month, identify the main changes, and prepare a short report." 
A simple LLM might generate a response based on information already available in its context. A 
