1. interpret the user's request;  
2. determine which data is required;  
3. retrieve the relevant information from a database;  
4. perform calculations;  
5. analyze the results;  
6. generate a report;  
7. and present the result to the user.  
The important change is that the system is not merely generating text. It is coordinating several 
capabilities to accomplish a task. 
